  description: A port depends on many kinds of labour. Sailors navigate and maintain
    a vessel; dock workers move its cargo. Inspect the ship's deck and cabin to see
    how objects and spaces can help explain that work. This station is a thematic
    reconstruction, not a record of one ship or city.
